# GTFS download cache — inputs to scripts/build-gtfs, not app assets
.gtfs-cache/

# Subagent worktrees. These are checkouts of this repo living inside it, so
# every tool that crawls the tree finds a second copy of the whole project:
# `git add -A` sees an embedded repository, Jest collected each suite twice
# (see the jest config in package.json), and tsc pulled a WIP branch into the
# root program (see tsconfig.json's exclude).
.claude/worktrees/
